        <p><em>The Journal of Inklings Studies</em> is the official journal of the Oxford C.S. Lewis Society and can be subscribed to directly from <a title="Journal of Inklings Studies Subscribe" href="http://www.euppublishing.com/page/ink/subscribe" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Edinburgh University Press</a> or as part of <a title="Oxford C.S. Lewis Society membership" href="http://www.oxfordcslewissociety.org/membership/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">society membership</a>.</p>
